msgstr "Sferic"

#. UI string guide0_s
msgid "guide0_s"
msgstr "Ko'och clic / ch'íik ch'íik"

#. UI string guide0_d
msgid "guide0_d"
msgstr ""
"Jun yúuchul uk'ux k'ahk' k'uch bey radiyo; yaab k'iin miles km náach. Le "
"jach yaab kuxa'anil señal; jun ko'och ts'éel síijil ti' le ha'jalab."

#. UI string guide1_t
msgid "guide1_t"
msgstr "Tweek"

#. UI string guide1_s
msgid "guide1_s"
msgstr "Chirp metáliko"

#. UI string guide1_d
msgid "guide1_d"
msgstr ""
"Jun sferic p'úuts' ichil lu'um–ionosfera. Le frekuensya ch'úuy k'uch "
"ts'o'ok, k'uch u cola — le k'uch \"J\" ti' náach 1.7 kHz. Chéen ti' áak'ab."

#. UI string guide2_t
msgid "guide2_t"
msgstr "Whistler"

#. UI string guide2_s
msgid "guide2_s"
msgstr "Silbido ko'och emel"

#. UI string guide2_d
msgid "guide2_d"
msgstr ""
"Le k'ahk' uk'ux k'ahk' súut yéetel le ts'éel magnetismo ichil magnetosfera, "
"k'uch súut. Yaan segundos, súut ti' p'ich ti' ch'úuy. Jach raro."

#. UI string guide3_t
msgid "guide3_t"
msgstr "Coro sáask'in"

#. UI string guide3_s
msgid "guide3_s"
msgstr "Bey t'u'ux ch'íich'"

#. UI string guide3_d
msgid "guide3_d"
msgstr ""
"Jun coro k'uch tumen electronob ichil magnetosfera; jach k'ahk' ti' sáask'in "
"yéetel ti' jach náachil latitud."

#. UI string guide4_t
msgid "guide4_t"
msgstr "Hum corriente"

#. UI string guide4_s
msgid "guide4_s"
msgstr "Zumbido jach chuk-páatal"

#. UI string guide4_d
msgid "guide4_d"
msgstr ""
"50 Hz yéetel u armonikoob — ma' kuxa'anil, tumen u elektri' le naj. Ts'o'k "
"ch'íik ti' le kanal Chi'; k'uch ti' le kanal Chùun."

#. UI string guide5_t
msgid "guide5_t"
msgstr "Ruido interruptor"

#. UI string guide5_s
msgid "guide5_s"
msgstr "Tonos duros chuk-páatal"

#. UI string guide5_d
msgid "guide5_d"
msgstr ""
"Cargador teléfono, driver LED, monitor. Ts'éel pach-páatal ma' súut ti' le "
"ha'jalab. Le proba referencia k'ajóolt yéetel ch'íik."

